      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9454454183578491,
      "reading_order": 14,
      "text": "To boost tourism in the state, the Uttar Pradesh government has established a “Heritage Arc” in 2014\ncovering the cities of Agra, Lucknow and Varanasi, the three most important tourist destinations. The\ngovernment expressed its intent to improve infrastructure including roads, pathways and condition of\nmonuments to attract tourists to promote the “Heritage Arc”."
    },
